[[2047,96,32768,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H35</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends the signal for\nactivating the rear fog lamps to the check device inside the rev\ncounter \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 1 of connector B).</p><p>The supply for the check device inside \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15\narrives directly from the battery (maxifuse B99) at pins 10 and\n16 of connector A, through fuses F2 and F3 of the junction unit\nB1;</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               The former protects the left hand lighting circuits, the\nlatter protects the right hand circuits.</p><p>The check device only controls (pin 4 and\npin 17 of connector A) the supply of the rear fog lamps in the centre\nrear light clusters on the left \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F35</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and the right \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F36</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               if\none of the two go ahead signals arrives from the dipped beam headlamps\nor the front ghts.</p><p>The first signal arrives from the dipped\nbeam headlamps circuit at pin 8 of connector A \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3233782\">E2011</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The second signal is supplied by the circuit\ninside the module \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              : it is the same signal which lights\nup the &#x27;front fog lights on&#x27; warning light.</p><p>At the same time as the lights are switched\non, the &#x27;rear fog lamps on&#x27; warning light - inside \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               -\nis also switched on with pin 14 of connector A providing the earth.\nThis signal also lights up the LED next to the button in \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H35</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>In the case of failures in the circuit,\nthe &#x27;lights failure&#x27; warning light - inside \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               - comes on,\nwith the supply controlled by the ignition (IINT), pin 15 of connector\nA, of the line protected by fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B11</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               up to 2/99 or by fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F4</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of\nthe additional fuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98B</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               from 2/99.</p><p>The switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H35</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is lit up when the\nside lights are switched on by means of the line coming from the\nswitch for the steering column switch unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p>"]]